**—** Remote (Europe only)


**—** Full\-time


**Intelvision** is looking for a skilled **Middle .NET Engineer.**


**Project description:** Our ecosystem is rapidly growing, and we are currently expanding our team to support new AI\-driven initiatives and integrations. In particular, we are building AI\-powered bots and automation tools that help streamline internal processes, enhance customer interactions, and support business growth. You will work closely with experienced engineers and product stakeholders, contributing to production\-level features and architectural decisions.


**Responsibilities:**



— Design, develop, and maintain backend services using **.NET / C\#**;



— Take ownership of features across the full development lifecycle, from estimation to deployment;



— Working with **Azure** services (App Services, Functions, etc.);



— Designing and maintaining REST APIs and system integrations;



— Implementing and integrating AI\-based solutions (RAG, semantic search, automation flows);



— Participating in technical discussions and architectural decisions;



— Ensuring code quality, performance, and scalability;



— Collaborating cross\-functionally with frontend, product, and DevOps teams.


**Requirements:**



— 2\.5 \+ years of experience with **.NET / C\#** (including experience with .NET 8 or similar modern versions);



— Strong understanding of backend development principles, **REST APIs**, and system integrations;



— Hands\-on experience with cloud platforms (**Azure,** OCI is a plus);



— Experience working with databases such as **PostgreSQL**;



— Experience with Git, Docker, and modern development workflows;



— Experience with AI\-related solutions (RAG, semantic search, automation);



— Strong problem\-solving skills and willingness to learn and fill knowledge gaps when needed;



— English level B2\+ (comfortable spoken and written communication with clients).


**Would be a plus:**



— Experience with Power Automate;



— Experience building or integrating AI/automation solutions;



— Understanding of system integrations.


**What we offer:**



— Remote\-first work environment;



— Supportive, performance\-driven team culture;



— Involvement in architecture discussions and technical decision\-making;



— Paid sick leaves and vacations;



— Complete hardware package;



— Refund of personal professional growth (courses, platforms, etc);



— Personal development plan;



— Internal accountant;



— Ability to select currency for your contract.



**Why Join Us**
---------------



We offer a wide range of benefits to make sure our team finds the right balance between work, home and personal development


* Gifts for a birthday and several occasions;11
* Periodical review process based on technical evaluation and English;
* Personal goals setting;
* Participation in Lviv IT Cluster;
* Refund of personal professional growth (courses, platforms, etc);
* Corporate events: regular team building activities;
* English speaking club;
* Game evening;
* Intelvision Talks;
* Flexible working hours (started workday until 11:00 a.m.);
* 18 days of vacation \+ 5 days of fully covered sick leaves and event more (we offer 20 and 22 days of vacations if we cooperate for more than 1 year) with the possibility to take a vacation in advance;
* A comfortable and cozy working environment with motivated colleagues.
